      <div class="mission-grid">
        <div class="mission-image">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469571486292-0ba58a3f068b?w=800&q=80"
            alt="Global Aid Alliance volunteers distributing emergency supplies to affected communities"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="mission-badge">
            <span>Est.</span>
            1947
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mission-text">
          <span class="section-label">Our Mission</span>
          <h2 class="section-title">Humanity. Impartiality. Neutrality.</h2>
          <p class="section-body">
            Global Aid Alliance prevents and alleviates human suffering in the face of emergencies by mobilizing the power of volunteers and the generosity of donors.
          </p>
          <p class="section-body" style="margin-top:16px;">
            We are guided by the fundamental principles of humanity, impartiality, and neutrality. Every day, our teams work across borders and boundaries to ensure that help reaches those who need it most — regardless of race, religion, nationality, or political affiliation.
          </p>
